Package: interimlook
Title: Evaluate Type I Error Across Interim Analyses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Nina", "Tang", email = "hydralynette@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calibrates efficacy-only group sequential designs under the
    canonical joint-normal model. Compares Lan-DeMets alpha-spending designs
    against repeated nominal testing, calculates operating characteristics,
    and validates results using Monte Carlo simulation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: statmod
Suggests: mvtnorm, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/shuxint/interimlook
BugReports: https://github.com/shuxint/interimlook/issues
